id: SCA-022
title: GitHub Actions checkout of PR head ref
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yml .yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: pull_request
patterns:
  - regex: ref:\s*\$\{\{\s*github\.event\.pull_request\.head\.(sha|ref)
    message: Checking out PR head ref in a pull_request_target workflow runs attacker code with elevated privileges and secret access. This was the TanStack attack vector.
fix: Never checkout PR head ref in a pull_request_target workflow. Use pull_request event for untrusted code. If you must use pull_request_target, only checkout the base branch.
